## How THIS repo maps to the docs

| Concern | AptCasino pattern | Doc archetype |
|---|---|---|
| Roulette / Wheel / Plinko | `e.rand()` → attested reveal → `settle` | [Incasino](https://docs.inco.org/games/incasino) play-then-settle |
| Mines | sealed seed → `commitMines` → reveal/cashout | [Mines](https://docs.inco.org/games/mines) encrypted board |
| Frontend | `@inco/lightning-js` `Lightning.baseSepoliaTestnet()` + `attestedReveal` | JS SDK attested reveal |
| Megapot | `MegapotRewardVault` → Sepolia `JackpotRandomTicketBuyer.buyTickets` | llms megapot-buy-random |
| Network today | **Base Sepolia (84532) only** | create-inco-app supports `NEXT_PUBLIC_NETWORK=mainnet` — not wired here yet |

Important Inco facts:
- Inco is **TEE-based**, not FHE/zk. "Provably fair" = covalidator attestation.
- Always `allowThis()` after storing encrypted handles; always fund Inco fees; never `if` on `ebool` — use `.select()`.
- ConfidentialDeck is for card/hidden-hand games; this casino correctly uses `e.rand()`, not ConfidentialDeck.

Megapot facts:
- Mainnet RandomTicketBuyer: `0xb9560b43b91dE2c1DaF5dfbb76b2CFcDaFc13aBd`
- Sepolia RandomTicketBuyer (used here): `0x53c04e7e5044B28Ea8A4F9c4b26E3Ac1aeb63746`
- Always pass referrer(s) on `buyTickets` when integrating for production revenue.
- Fetch ABIs from `https://llms.megapot.io/abi/<Name>.json` rather than freezing stale copies.

## When implementing further work

1. Read the lightning skill (`SKILL.md` + `references/games/*`) for privacy/settlement decisions.
2. Query Inco MCP for current signatures.
3. For Megapot purchases/claims/UI, follow https://llms.megapot.io/ decision tree.
4. Keep Megapot inside the **game loop** (credits → claim), not marketing link-outs only.
